From 3e9984838f3991a31aac7cd9aefa4a7c0720ead5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christian Ott <cott@bethe.tapir.caltech.edu>
Date: Mon, 9 Jul 2012 06:39:16 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 04/10] GRHydro: improve error handling in C2P hot routine

* improve error handling in C2P hot routine
* further bugfix to tau reset treatment in hot part
* fix an inconsistency in hot-EOS Con2Prim routine -- when resetting
  utau, also reset tau for consistency
---
 src/GRHydro_Con2Prim.F90 |   26 ++++++++++++++++++--------
 1 file changed, 18 insertions(+), 8 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/GRHydro_Con2Prim.F90 b/src/GRHydro_Con2Prim.F90
index 9f5e511..22afcd3 100644
--- a/src/GRHydro_Con2Prim.F90
+++ b/src/GRHydro_Con2Prim.F90
@@ -3,7 +3,6 @@
    @date      Sat Jan 26 01:06:01 2002
    @author    The GRHydro Developers
    @desc 
-   The routines for converting conservative to primitive variables.
    @enddesc 
  @@*/
 
