From c4fd2d250aa2e24cf3977ac7875f360e7508c086 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Philipp Moesta <pmoesta@tapir.caltech.edu>
Date: Fri, 17 Aug 2012 02:37:22 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 06/10] GRHydro: Changes fixing issues with hot EOS treatment:
 1) Set correct keytemp in C2P 2) Fix OpenMP private
 variable declaration in HLLEM 3) Fix velocity
 arguments for Y_e 1D PPM reconstruction 4) If in
 atmosphere and if evolve a Y_e also reset Y_e with
 cell averaged value in Reconstruction 5) Fix index
 permutation bug in ReconstructPoly routines for
 divergence cleaning field 6) Remove extra comment
 character in UpdateMaskM 7) Fix a missing velocity
 permutation when calling 1D reconstruction for Y_e.
 8) Insert missing sqrt(det) factor for pressure term
 in resetting tau when temperature got too cold with a
 hot EOS.

